{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.66.68.111","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6f775e4fdc347c2ae9fe9b345bf9876a","RawContent":"We got married at the Grand Sirenis in the Mayan Riveria.  I felt it was very budget friendly. Both for guests and wedding packages.  In 2015 our Alberta guests paid $1565 all in for 7 nights and our Ontario guests $1465.   We had 45 people and a lot of extras for around $5500 Canadian.   I agree with Ann, your TA should be helping to guide your decision! \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1912463,"PostDate":1459693481,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We got married at the Grand Sirenis in the Mayan Riveria.  I felt it was very budget friendly. Both for guests and wedding packages.  In 2015 our Alberta guests paid $1565 all in for 7 nights and our Ontario guests $1465.   We had 45 people and a lot of extras for around $5500 Canadian.   I agree with Ann, your TA should be helping to guide your decision! <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"168.208.215.217","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd340eac5df3faaf1414591b0b9a212a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are planning on getting married at the Barcel\u00f3 Maya Colonial in Feb 2017.&amp;nbsp; I found that the prices there for both travel packs for the guests and weddings are very reasonable.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyone else out there considering Barcel\u00f3 or have any pros\/cons :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912805,"PostDate":1460458220,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are planning on getting married at the Barcel\u00f3 Maya Colonial in Feb 2017.\u00a0 I found that the prices there for both travel packs for the guests and weddings are very reasonable.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyone else out there considering Barcel\u00f3 or have any pros\/cons <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stasia2914@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.73.80.191","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1442779509,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"smfahey","Id":284874,"Name":"smfahey","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"148.106.4.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02758e97fc79f9057d155cc3d910e275","RawContent":"[quote name=\"smfahey\" post=\"1912805\" timestamp=\"1460472620\"]\nHello,\n\nWe are planning on getting married at the Barcel\u00f3 Maya Colonial in Feb 2017.  I found that the prices there for both travel packs for the guests and weddings are very reasonable. \n\nAnyone else out there considering Barcel\u00f3 or have any pros\/cons :)[\/quote]I am also looking at this hotel! what packages did they offer you?","Attachments":[],"Id":1912807,"PostDate":1460458668,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>smfahey, on 12 April 2016 - 10:50 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are planning on getting married at the Barcel\u00f3 Maya Colonial in Feb 2017.\u00a0 I found that the prices there for both travel packs for the guests and weddings are very reasonable.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyone else out there considering Barcel\u00f3 or have any pros\/cons <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>I am also looking at this hotel! what packages did they offer you?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karina@love.com","IpAddress":"148.106.4.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1459260714,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"karinaL","Id":286603,"Name":"karinaL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.29.96.108","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4d86f11dfaf13d63aec6ffce7e17f4a4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are in the process of booking Hyatt Ziva in Cancun for 2017! We visited there a few weeks ago and I cannot emphasize enough how absolutely stunning the property is!! We took a wedding tour and really liked the different venue options and Jessica the wedding coordinator has been so sweet and helpful in answering all my questions that have come up since then. Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912827,"PostDate":1460503049,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are in the process of booking Hyatt Ziva in Cancun for 2017! We visited there a few weeks ago and I cannot emphasize enough how absolutely stunning the property is!! We took a wedding tour and really liked the different venue options and Jessica the wedding coordinator has been so sweet and helpful in answering all my questions that have come up since then. Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"grepousis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.29.96.108","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1459810833,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Gerri430","Id":286648,"Name":"Gerri430","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.254.50.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"afb58d3241b8477a21ee84d7239465e4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi there - the future husband and I are also looking at booking in Mexico 2017\/early 2018. We will be seeing a Travel Agent next week to get the ball rolling and narrow down resort choices but we like Mexico (I have heard it&#039;s the best price wise). I cannot recommend the Barcelo Deluxe resort in Riviera Maya enough - went there for a wedding and it was beautiful. Good luck with your planning&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912905,"PostDate":1460796846,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi there - the future husband and I are also looking at booking in Mexico 2017\/early 2018. We will be seeing a Travel Agent next week to get the ball rolling and narrow down resort choices but we like Mexico (I have heard it's the best price wise). I cannot recommend the Barcelo Deluxe resort in Riviera Maya enough - went there for a wedding and it was beautiful. Good luck with your planning\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carriemorlang@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.254.50.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460796318,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"clyn","Id":286739,"Name":"clyn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"89c0e27aa3b716c1e51fd83c041de930","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"margin-left:35.4pt;\"&gt;Hi&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Karina!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff11c1;\"&gt;Congratulations&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt; on your engagement!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;we want to present to you Las Caletas Puerto VallartaMexico, this venue is a truly magical place to exchange your vows and celebrate this special occasion. It is our &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ff33cc;\"&gt;private beach cove in the south bay and is only accessible by sea&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#595959;\"&gt;, &amp;nbsp;It covers an enormous area and features several beaches, &amp;nbsp;various facilities\/buildings (spa, kitchens, eating areas\/restaurants, bars, restrooms, etc.), and several hundred acres of tropical forest.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;we have different packages to offer you,&amp;nbsp;all includes open bar,dinner, trasportation, ceremony and reception set up, etc..&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Contact us:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/bit.ly\/PlanYourWedding&#039;&gt;http:\/\/bit.ly\/PlanYourWedding&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83034]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:82978]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:82970]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81805]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81627]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913329,"PostDate":1462385572,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"margin-left:35.4pt\">Hi\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Karina!<\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong><span  style=\"color:#ff11c1\">Congratulations<\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"color:#595959\"> on your engagement!!!\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#595959\">we want to present to you Las Caletas Puerto VallartaMexico, this venue is a truly magical place to exchange your vows and celebrate this special occasion. It is our <\/span><span  style=\"color:#ff33cc\">private beach cove in the south bay and is only accessible by sea<\/span><span  style=\"color:#595959\">, \u00a0It covers an enormous area and features several beaches, \u00a0various facilities\/buildings (spa, kitchens, eating areas\/restaurants, bars, restrooms, etc.), and several hundred acres of tropical forest.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>we have different packages to offer you,\u00a0all includes open bar,dinner, trasportation, ceremony and reception set up, etc..<\/p>\n<p>Contact us:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/bit.ly\/PlanYourWedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bit.ly\/PlanYourWedding<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/83034-ceremony-at-paradise\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_2597851.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='ceremony at paradise'  width='200' height='134'  alt='ceremony at paradise' id='sml_image_view_83034' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/82978-mg-4829\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18167\/sml_gallery_258213_18167_2296320.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='MG 4829'  width='200' height='134'  alt='MG 4829' id='sml_image_view_82978' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/82970-trasportation\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18165\/sml_gallery_258213_18165_2657384.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='trasportation'  width='200' height='132'  alt='trasportation' id='sml_image_view_82970' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81805-starfish\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_675256.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Starfish !!'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Starfish !!' id='sml_image_view_81805' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81627-wedding-reception-at-las-caletas\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_661060.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Wedding Reception at Las Caletas'  width='200' height='154'  alt='Wedding Reception at Las Caletas' id='sml_image_view_81627' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343044403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"131.137.245.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e349181d4461af1a5cc856fbbf6f0e56","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;there are many rooftop venues or gazeebo type venues that allow for amazing views - Sandos has many options at their luxury resort in Riviera Maya that can accomadate your whole group - up to 150 guests&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913553,"PostDate":1462896116,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>there are many rooftop venues or gazeebo type venues that allow for amazing views - Sandos has many options at their luxury resort in Riviera Maya that can accomadate your whole group - up to 150 guests<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adamphall@ymail.com","IpAddress":"131.137.245.206","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1462868136,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286918.jpg?_r=1462901352","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AdamnJenn17","Id":286918,"Name":"AdamnJenn17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"86.20.173.230","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80019,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2077b431ae1a98d6d79000f08b4f5f65","RawContent":"Hey, we have booked to get married may 2017 at the grand bahia tullum, the price was amazing and with half the wedding party being children under 10 we needed a child friendly hotel. I have just booked the wedding package through Thomas Cook. We are all staying at the resort so no need for drink package and our meal will be taken off our a la carte allowence for the holiday. I&#039;m assuming the photographer is the hotel based one we get 10 pics with the package but my father in law to be has a nac with cameras so he is going to take most pics.  The only thing I&#039;m worrying about is flowers (I know I have a year) but from pictures I&#039;ve seen all looks amazing x\n\n\nSent from my SM-G900F using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1914105,"PostDate":1464749817,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey, we have booked to get married may 2017 at the grand bahia tullum, the price was amazing and with half the wedding party being children under 10 we needed a child friendly hotel. I have just booked the wedding package through Thomas Cook. We are all staying at the resort so no need for drink package and our meal will be taken off our a la carte allowence for the holiday. I'm assuming the photographer is the hotel based one we get 10 pics with the package but my father in law to be has a nac with cameras so he is going to take most pics.  The only thing I'm worrying about is flowers (I know I have a year) but from pictures I've seen all looks amazing x<br><br>\nSent from my SM-G900F using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaimemccallion@googlemail.com","IpAddress":"86.20.173.230","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1464749324,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jaimemccallion","Id":287053,"Name":"jaimemccallion","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":28,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
