m a bit nervous because of one thing, we really would love to have our ceremony on the Sky deck, but what about rain! I know they give you an alternate location, but what about the 1800usd that has been paid? I&#039;m guessing it wouldn&#039;t be refunded? Any insight to this , thanks .","Attachments":[],"Id":1909685,"PostDate":1453153815,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hey ladies ! So it's come time to put down my deposit for Azul fives ! I'm a bit nervous because of one thing, we really would love to have our ceremony on the Sky deck, but what about rain! I know they give you an alternate location, but what about the 1800usd that has been paid? I'm guessing it wouldn't be refunded? Any insight to this , thanks . \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"deannakawecki@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.224.81.241","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1446506608,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Deannak","Id":285230,"Name":"Deannak","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.88.49.88","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79872,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by ashhtayy, 18 January 2016 - 10:23 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1453155838,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f4a3f207a138747c766e8b10db0e0010","RawContent":"@[member=\"Deannak\"] Hi! I recently asked myself. On the day of your wedding if your wedding coordinator says you should not get married outside due to rain and you chose to move your wedding indoors they will reimburse you the $1800. If you choose to go ahead despite there warning and it rains you lose the $1800.\n\n\nPs. You&#039;ll find lots of details here for azul fives - &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76708-azul-fives-brides-2015\/page-87&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76708-azul-fives-brides-2015\/page-87&lt;\/a&gt;- the forum is dead but there is lots of info in there :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1909686,"PostDate":1453155654,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285230\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285230-deannak\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Deannak<\/span><\/a> Hi! I recently asked myself. On the day of your wedding if your wedding coordinator says you should not get married outside due to rain and you chose to move your wedding indoors they will reimburse you the $1800. If you choose to go ahead despite there warning and it rains you lose the $1800.<br><br>\nPs. You'll find lots of details here for azul fives - <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76708-azul-fives-brides-2015\/page-87' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...es-2015\/page-87<\/a>- the forum is dead but there is lots of info in there <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Ashley<br><br>My Planning Thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79377-ashhtayys-planning-thread-azul-fives-june-7-2016\/<\/a><br>\u00a0<\/p><div><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><\/div><div><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160607\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ecf1\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/div><div><\/a><\/div>","Email":"ashley.taylor@live.ca","IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1423090661,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1451447049","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":210,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79872,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d7491e14c598c3bf684b0ff3d953dd03","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Also&amp;nbsp;@[member=\"Deannak\"] azul fives has some beautiful options in case of rain.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909692,"PostDate":1453161788,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Also\u00a0@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285230\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285230-deannak\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Deannak<\/span><\/a> azul fives has some beautiful options in case of rain.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.161.170.48","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79872,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 19 January 2016 - 03:12 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1453216365,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a78117a1708101f53e1c68e9a3e66978","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Joyce always has such helpful info.....thx for that :) We agree about the picturesque spots at Azul Fives.....which you can see for yourselves in these magical wedding moments that matter we captured there....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153681635889487.1073741949.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Azul Fives Wedding Story Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/12091401_10153681638734487_7944233725687063293_o.jpg\" alt=\"12091401_10153681638734487_7944233725687\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/12022328_10153681641839487_2113754270007651432_o.jpg\" alt=\"12022328_10153681641839487_2113754270007\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/12068789_10153681642269487_4671098918606802189_o.jpg\" alt=\"12068789_10153681642269487_4671098918606\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research and all the best with your planning decisions - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1909723,"PostDate":1453216339,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Joyce always has such helpful info.....thx for that <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> We agree about the picturesque spots at Azul Fives.....which you can see for yourselves in these magical wedding moments that matter we captured there....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153681635889487.1073741949.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Azul Fives Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xtp1\/t31.0-8\/12091401_10153681638734487_7944233725687063293_o.jpg\" alt=\"12091401_10153681638734487_7944233725687\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/12022328_10153681641839487_2113754270007651432_o.jpg\" alt=\"12022328_10153681641839487_2113754270007\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-yyz1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpf1\/t31.0-8\/12068789_10153681642269487_4671098918606802189_o.jpg\" alt=\"12068789_10153681642269487_4671098918606\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research and all the best with your planning decisions - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"131.137.245.209","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79872,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa4b121df42a977d403a28de6e688e37","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wether you are working with a TA, airline or directly with the hotel dont hesitate to ask questions - you will find them very friendly and forthcoming.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913593,"PostDate":1462901765,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wether you are working with a TA, airline or directly with the hotel dont hesitate to ask questions - you will find them very friendly and forthcoming.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adamphall@ymail.com","IpAddress":"131.137.245.206","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1462868136,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286918.jpg?_r=1462901352","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"